{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_03_beg","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_03","title":"無聲破裂","storyCode":"BB-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"69a7c0f3b360c788ea178a4791a47f05c40c2610ad11f5f9709a26e478d1426d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"八年前\n1086年夏\n卡茲戴爾地區，卡茲戴爾移動城市民居"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g8_scarmarketcamp"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我來看看委託。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我見過的那麼多雇傭兵裡，你也算是最貪得無厭的，好運。你是打算存錢去哥倫比亞買座莊園嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活著已經不錯了，好運。呵，從活得長這個角度看，你也確實配得上“好運”這名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說有一批大單子，有高價的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近風頭很緊，城裡有人一直盯著，前幾個接的人下場都不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是牽扯巴別塔的事情，你確定想接？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接，我運氣一向很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，最近城裡有個教書的，每天都在替巴別塔那幫外族人講話，有人花錢買他的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待你還能給我帶來什麼驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祝你的好運今天別到頭，老兄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，卡茲戴爾移動城市"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"好運很久都沒有回到過這裡。\n城裡變了很多，許多人來了又走，“巴別塔”、“軍事委員會”這些字眼他並不陌生，總有人為一些他完全不明白的問題鬧得不可開交。\n他不懂，大家都是薩卡茲，到底有什麼好爭的。\n他拿出照片，檢查了一下目標的長相，看上去是個有些秀氣的年輕人，身上三角形的標誌十分眼熟。\n一個老師。替巴別塔的外族人說話。煽動對軍事委員會的反抗。\n真不走運，今天你的生命就要到頭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看行蹤，應該是在這附近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，為什麼是這裡……"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使很久都沒回來過，他也清楚記得，這是他的家。\n也是奧達的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧達，你不該參與進來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"躲好，不要出聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……是要找誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是我敲錯門了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您需要幫忙嗎？這一片我很熟。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他在微笑，他的眼神中沒有慌亂。\n阿斯卡綸的視線迅速掃過簡陋的房間，心中已經了然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉思的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1304_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是巴別塔的成員，我叫阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你庇護他，但是，你們得離開這附近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意安全，最近不安穩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你得走了，你也聽見了，恐怕已經有人注意到你們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只軍事委員會的人，之前還有那麼多上門挑釁的傭兵……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，奧達，你願意將屋子偷偷借給我們當教室，我已經很感激了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些孩子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會送他們回家，放心。過兩天，等風頭過了，你們還是可以在這裡上課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，奧達。就像我一直說的，我準備離開了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了給這群孩子講完課，我已經拖了太久了。接下來，我還要去更多地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。對了，這些馬鈴薯別忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子們知道你的情況，東湊西湊總能拿出來一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝，謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要說謝謝的是我，非常感謝您。在您的課上，我學到了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年卡茲戴爾建設得很快，但人們的知識與思想還沒有跟上卡茲戴爾建設的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不改變現狀，我們擁有的力量遲早會毀滅我們自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在城裡的種種爭紛，薩卡茲本不該如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可我還沒有找到改變現狀的辦法。但我確定的是，答案不會在卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老師”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1308_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，奧達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見……祝您旅途順利。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"奧達望著消失在街角的“老師”，遲遲沒有進屋。\n不知從何時起，他養成了每天坐在門口的習慣。他期待著，一直期待著一個人回來。\n風拂起了街道的塵土，塵土又勾起他的淚意。什麼影子也沒有。\n他輕輕關上了門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧達……"},{"type":"narration","text":"好運看到目標從屋子裡走出來，緊接著，他又看到了一個許久不見的熟悉的身影。\n他手裡的刀變得無比沉重，他一時動彈不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧達……對不起……我都不知道你們什麼時候……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好運","speakerId":"avg_npc_1305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是個稱職的父親……但……"},{"type":"narration","text":"他握緊了刀。\n他只知道這一個辦法，能為奧達賺得一個更好的未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……又一個。"},{"type":"narration","text":"煙霧掠過了街角一具屍體，抹去了其存在的痕跡。\n無聲，寂靜。生命的消逝如同塵埃墜向大地，無人在意。\n死亡終於追上了好運已盡的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還準備躲多久？或者，你打算現在就偷襲我……曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一個傭兵，這是第幾個了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要記住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能殺一個，殺兩個，殺一百個，但你能殺掉所有前赴後繼接下委託的傭兵嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只是想要提醒我們，大家安於現狀太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用巴別塔成員的性命來提醒？提醒誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他曾親自向殿下許諾。這就是他口中對巴別塔的“嚴格保護”？我只看到無止境的審查和對傭兵的放縱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……阿斯卡綸，有些話不能說，尤其是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有意見，可以拿下我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好讓我看看你在他身邊有沒有長進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在將軍身邊學會的，比暴力更重要，阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，看看現在，誰才是那個只知道殺人的劊子手？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有本事別躲！我一定向兩位殿下證明我能贏你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太慢，曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站……起來就站起來……再來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，注意自己的腳步。阿斯卡綸，別總是打他的頭啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭是要害，是他自己避不開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他自己躲不開，這些疼痛他就必須要學會承受。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，你說得沒錯，可你怎麼能在叫停前停手分心？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……我能挺住，殿下！再來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_1302_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……擊中了？殿下，我打中——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_1301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放我下來，阿斯卡綸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸，小心別傷到他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"高瘦的曼弗雷德凌空撲騰著，他的身體已經被綁縛在木樁之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可能這麼快，你怎麼做到的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從殿下織衣服的手法裡找到了些靈感。"},{"type":"narration","text":"曼弗雷德試圖掙扎擺脫束縛，但卻被越縛越緊。\n他不理解，這個同樣瘦弱的女孩為何不只力量如此驚人……連行動的速度他都難以企及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放——我——下——來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殿下，看，我又贏了！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸高舉著手中的武器，咧嘴向兩位殿下宣示著自己的勝利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸開朗了許多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在想什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們和其他的薩卡茲孩子相比，很不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的確能夠潛移默化改變他們，但我們又如何能顧及卡茲戴爾的所有孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"給我一些時間。巴別塔能做到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間是最珍貴的耗材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。但教育並非急功近利的事業，我們所做的，無非是將希望留給後來人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要卡茲戴爾還有一位老師願意將我們最美好的未來講述給這些孩子，希望的火種就永遠不會熄滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"將目光投向那兩個玩鬧的孩子，特蕾西婭依舊對未來充滿期盼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你現在認輸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不！嗚……放我下來，我們再來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"認輸我就放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你休想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，我來幫你解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝殿下！欸……我怎麼感覺快飛起來了……殿、殿下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好了，特蕾西婭，快放他下來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有長進，但特雷西斯顯然沒有把自己會的全教給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是學得更快的那個，但離開將軍之後，我在你身上只看到了無所適從。他對你的離開很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒你那麼善辯。但我至少不會心安理得地漠視他人對於特蕾西婭殿下的冒犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的理解特蕾西婭殿下為何堅持巴別塔的理念嗎？你真的明白為什麼將軍不會出面阻攔對巴別塔的襲擊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起一走了之，你當初應該和他好好聊聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一走了之？是你們拋棄了殿下，無視了許多人的聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到的，是他縱容傭兵肆意製造混亂，他對巴別塔的損失無動於衷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍默許這一切，正是因為他不能無視大多數人的聲音——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果薩卡茲的命運會不可避免地滑入深淵，那用更有效的手段來挽回又何妨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這才是你的真實想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是大部分卡茲戴爾人民的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並非不信任殿下……可美好的未來誰都能許諾，但人們不能無視眼前的現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你用暴力讓一個剛剛失去父親的孩子和兇手握手言和，那不是更殘忍嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……隨你怎麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會對軍事委員會的人動手，但如果你們想假借那些傭兵行事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要做的就很簡單了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要一個傭兵都不剩，問題也就解決了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡綸……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……有時間的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去看看殿下，我從未見過她像現在這樣疲憊。"},{"type":"narration","text":"唯有空氣擾動起的煙塵能證明，她已經離開。\n曼弗雷德低下頭，拭去胸口緩緩滲出的鮮血。\n他嘆口氣，轉過無人的街道，卻意外瞥見了街角某位死去傭兵的遺物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……總有一天，我們都得明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做出選擇的從來不是殿下，或是將軍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g1_kazdelroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他猶豫著，不敢開門。\n這間破舊的小屋子今天真是忙碌，送走了那位“老師”，又接連有人造訪。\n門外站著的會是誰？\n是父親回來了嗎？如果真的是他，自己又該說些什麼呢？\n這幾年，他回來的次數越來越少了……明明自己很想將從“老師”那裡學來的東西，分享給父親。\n深呼吸了許久，他調整好情緒，裝出鎮定的樣子打開了門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……好？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是……長官，呃，您有事找我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，長官，只是您身上穿著軍事委員會的制服，我以前見過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，只是例行檢查——你認識這些東西嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這，這是……我父親的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收好吧。城裡最近有些騷亂，你的父親……很不幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您……是在什麼地方找到的？那裡是否還有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，現場只留下了這些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什麼名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奧達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要幫助……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不用了……您能把這些東西送還給我，我很感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實很久沒見過他了，這些東西……就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我終於不用一直等著了，不用……一直等他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有其他親人或朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我自己能處理好這些事情。況且，這座城裡每天都能看到相似的事情，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，長官，情不自禁就向您說了很多。不知道為什麼，總覺得您很親切……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奧達","speakerId":"avg_4131_odda_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您還有很多事情要忙吧，耽誤您的時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……節哀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g3_kazdelstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"靜靜站在門前，曼弗雷德聽到裡面隱約傳來的啜泣聲，但他卻無法感到悲傷。\n他的確見過了太多。可是在殿下最初的藍圖裡，這座城市本不該這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
